Authentication Flow (OAuth)
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant CLI
    participant Server
    participant OAuthProvider

    User->>CLI: loom login
    CLI->>Server: GET /auth/github/start
    Server->>Server: Generate state token
    Server->>Server: Store in session
    Server-->>CLI: 302 Redirect to GitHub
    CLI->>User: Open browser

    User->>OAuthProvider: Visit auth URL
    OAuthProvider->>User: Display approval page
    User->>OAuthProvider: Authorize
    OAuthProvider-->>Server: Callback with code
    Server->>OAuthProvider: Exchange code for token
    OAuthProvider-->>Server: Access token
    Server->>Server: Fetch user profile
    Server->>Server: Create/update user
    Server->>Server: Create session
    Server-->>User: Redirect to success page
    Server-->>CLI: Session token
    CLI->>CLI: Store credentials